@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-15  Read, delete, or expire a conversation
' Requirements: AI-05 AI-07 DATA-01 PERM-02 PERM-03 PERM-04
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Student" as U
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
U -> S: Open own saved conversation
alt At least 90 days since last message, or previously deleted
  S --> U: Conversation is no longer available
  note over S
  Do not supply expired/deleted messages as AI context.
  end note
else Conversation is still available
  S --> U: Show messages without using daily AI allowance
  opt Student deletes conversation sooner
    U -> S: Delete own conversation
    S --> U: Remove from accessible history and future AI context
  end
end
note over U,S
Keep accepted roadmaps, learning records, and badges.
Do not restore used AI allowance.
No Faculty, Program Head, or Administrator chat access.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-15 | Product behavior
@enduml
